From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: awtrix-ng-tc002 <port@awtrix-ng-tc002.invalid>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 16:19:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] render: scale text and decorations on a 16-row panel
 (AWTRIX_TC002)

Fonts are expanded 2x so 32 by 8 layouts keep their proportions on 52 by 16;
progress bars, status pixels, indicators and the icon gap scale with them, page
icons may be any size up to the panel and classic 8-row art is doubled. Bar
charts keep the upstream layout at scale 1. All of it is inert unless
AWTRIX_TC002 makes displayTextScale() return 2.

